{
  "scope": "Paper evidence audit of archived results only; no PDE solve, GPU call, or timing run performed.",
  "recommended_claim": "固定随机特征Galerkin不可压NS求解器的成本分解、条件性分析与同精度验证；具有局部算子/启动收益和数值可行性，但尚未建立最终强对照下稳定整体速度优势。",
  "problem": {
    "equations": "u_t+(u·∇)u=-∇p+νΔu, ∇·u=0; 2D finite annulus a<r<R. Re=U_inf D/ν=100, D=2a=1,U_inf=1,a=0.5,R=6,ν=0.01,T=72.",
    "coordinates": "s=ln(r/a), L=ln(R/a), z=s/L. Nonzero angular modes use ψ; ur=(1/r)∂θψ, uθ=-(1/r)∂sψ, ω=-(1/r²)(ψ_ss+ψ_θθ). Mode0 tangential velocity v(s,t) advanced independently, ω0=(v+v_s)/r.",
    "angular_representation": "Real fields c0+2Re(sum_{k=1}^K c_k exp(ikθ)); complex c_k retain both sine and cosine. No reflection constraint; negative modes follow real-field conjugacy, not discarded physical parity.",
    "initial": "Rest: ψ=0 and v=0 at t=0; all state coefficients and histories zero. First time step backward Euler with ramp-consistent zero nonlinearity.",
    "boundary": "At cylinder r=a: ψ=ψ_s=0 (no slip), v=0. At outer r=R: ψ=R[U(t)sinθ-V(t)cosθ], nonzero-mode ω=0; mean satisfies v_s+v=0. This does not prescribe full uniform velocity on outer circle.",
    "forcing": "U(t)=1-exp[-(t/0.8)^3]; V(t)=0.12 sin^4[π(t-4)/8] for 4<t<12, zero otherwise.",
    "lift": "ψ_lift=ell(s)[U sinθ-V cosθ], ell=R[(1-b)z²+b z³], b=(L²-2)/4. In complex mode1 code amplitude=-(V+iU)/2. ell(0)=ell_s(0)=0; ell(L)=R, ell_ss(L)=R, hence outer ω1=0.",
    "sources": [
      "work/rfm_v6/full_case.py:speed,lift",
      "work/rfm_v6/full_galerkin.py:fields_on,mean_jets",
      "work/rfm_v6/fd_full.py:FullFD.__init__"
    ]
  },
  "discretization": {
    "RFM_features": "For odd m, p=(m-1)/2. Frequencies b_j=(j+ξ_j)*62/p for j=0..p-1, ξ_j~Uniform(0.2,0.8), independently under NumPy default_rng(seed). Include constant and paired cos/sin via phases 0,-π/2. Raw arguments (z-1/2)b_j+phase. Boundary correction clamped(...farfield) and six outer-layer enrichments follow before weighted column-scaled SVD.",
    "RFM_boundary_transform": "Multiply seed functions g(z) by 16z²(1-z), then subtract [z²(1-z)²/2] times the product second derivative at z=1. This enforces ψ=ψ_s=0 at0 and ψ=ψ_ss=0 at1. Derivatives in s carry L^-1,L^-2.",
    "layers": "β=(16,36,80,165,340,660); d=L-s. Nonzero mode fβ=z²[d+(β+2/L)d²]exp(-βd). Mean fβ=z[1+(β+1+1/L)d]exp(-βd).",
    "SVD": "Nonzero transform via column-scaled sampled (f_ss-f) sqrt(w)/r, relative singular-value cutoff 1e-10. Thus input m and final retained rank differ. Mean base order24 plus6layers gives mean retained rank30. Fixed feature weights; no PINN residual training.",
    "Legendre": "Same boundary/layer/quadrature/SVD pipeline, polynomial seed functions Legendre degree0..m-1 in2z-1, evaluated by differentiated recurrence. The deterministic Galerkin baseline is itself traditional CFD.",
    "FD": "n denotes intervals, n+1 nodes; n-1=175 or183 interior radial unknowns per mode for FD176/184, so protocol retained_rank=n for FD is a label, not the Galerkin algebraic rank. s_j=L sin(πj/(2n)), outer clustering. Fourth-order radial differences; all time schemes remain second-order SBDF2. FD176 dense CUDA andFD184 band CUDA both qualified; FD184dense failed implementation gate historically.",
    "quadrature": "Split Gauss in s over[0,L-0.12],[L-0.12,L-0.018],[L-0.018,L], counts q-2b,b,b with b=max(8,floor(q/6)). Midq66=>44+11+11;highq76=>52+12+12.",
    "FFT": "N=next_fast_len(3K+1,real=True), N225 forK72 andN243 forK80, strictN>3K prevents wrapped quadratic modes entering retained band. Galerkin3inverse+2forward;FD4inverse+1forward;5 logical field transforms per nonlinear evaluation.",
    "sources": [
      "work/rfm_v3/cylinder_rfm.py:Trial,clamped",
      "work/rfm_v6/full_galerkin.py:scaled_svd,FullGalerkin",
